 4. 🖼️ Rubio&#x27;s meme gift 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Marc Caputo/Axios For his 55th birthday earlier this year, White House staffers and President Trump gifted Secretary of State Marco Rubio with a gold-framed collage of their 68 favorite " Rubio Realizing " memes, Axios' Marc Caputo writes. 

 The memes are based on a photo from one of the most awkward moments in the Trump White House, when the president and Vice President Vance excoriated Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky over the war with Russia last year. 📸 The backstory: Rubio showed the picture to Marc in early August before an exclusive interview about how he's approaching Cuba policy. 

 Rubio had not yet hung it on the wall in his White House office, where it sat on a couch — an unwitting meta reference to the meme's underlying photograph of him sitting on a sofa. More on the Rubio memes . 

 
 
